# OAuth apps.
# GitHub OAuth Apps allow multiple callback URLs. Separate dev/prod apps are
# recommended so local credentials cannot be used in production:
#   nightmaxxing-dev -> http://api.nightmaxxing.localhost:8788/auth/github/callback
#   nightmaxxing     -> https://api.maxxing.nrght.eu/auth/github/callback
# This file (.env) holds DEV pairs and only feeds `bun run dev`.
# Deploys load .env.production (prod pairs) via --env-file;
# CI deploys on main pushes use repo secrets instead.
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
ADMIN_EMAILS=
